Description: drm platform: include <stdio.h> and <xkbcommon/xkbcommon.h> directly
 Same transitive-include problem as patch 0002 (libwpewebkit 2.36 headers no longer pull them in):
 'stderr' undeclared, XKB_KEY_DOWN/XKB_STATE_MODS_* undeclared. The DRM platform is not used on the Pi 4
 (black screen, see pi/systemd/pi-dashboard.service) but the package build needs the module.
Author: room-devices
--- a/platform/drm/cog-platform-drm.c
+++ b/platform/drm/cog-platform-drm.c
@@ -7,6 +7,8 @@
 #include <libinput.h>
 #include <libudev.h>
+#include <stdio.h>
 #include <string.h>
 #include <wayland-server.h>
 #include <wpe/fdo.h>
+#include <xkbcommon/xkbcommon.h>
 #include <wpe/fdo-egl.h>
